{
 "type": "intro",
 "lines": [
  {
   "host": "A",
   "text": "It's Monday, September 28th, and this is The AI Edge, presented by Epilogue."
  },
  {
   "host": "B",
   "text": "The rules this briefing runs on are Epilogue's rules. Verify against the primary source. Withhold whatever doesn't reconcile. Show the trace. It's an AI venture studio and consultancy in Toronto, building for work where the answer has to be right. More at epiloguelabs.com."
  },
  {
   "host": "A",
   "text": "I'm Maya."
  },
  {
   "host": "B",
   "text": "And I'm Alex."
  },
  {
   "host": "A",
   "text": "A day at the frontier of AI — what shipped, what got published, and how it's being used, for good and for harm. Where we could read a source, it's linked on the site; where a page wouldn't open, we say so in the item."
  },
  {
   "host": "B",
   "text": "What's leading?"
  },
  {
   "host": "A",
   "text": "Hardware. Nvidia answered this month's run of agent escapes with a containment platform: a sandboxing runtime on its Vera CPUs, and a watchdog on BlueField-4 DPUs that Nvidia says can quarantine a boundary-breaking agent in milliseconds. An Nvidia executive said Hugging Face reported over 17,000 agents attacking its infrastructure for days and weeks."
  },
  {
   "host": "B",
   "text": "Second, the bill coming due. An Australian Senate inquiry has asked Sam Altman and Dario Amodei to appear in Canberra on Thursday, and MIT Technology Review reports that the state laws written for this moment only require reporting above 50 deaths or physical injuries, or $1 billion in damage."
  },
  {
   "host": "A",
   "text": "And third, a number from a NeurIPS paper. Split a harmful objective across several agent skills, and each piece looks fine on its own — but the combination succeeds 89.4% of the time against OpenClaw, Claude Code and Codex."
  }
 ]
}
--- outro ---
{
 "type": "outro",
 "lines": [
  {
   "host": "B",
   "text": "That's The AI Edge for today. The full edition is on the site, with links to the sources behind it."
  },
  {
   "host": "A",
   "text": "Where a page wouldn't open for us, we've said so in the item rather than quietly filling the gap."
  },
  {
   "host": "B",
   "text": "Our voices are AI-generated."
  },
  {
   "host": "A",
   "text": "Listen in tomorrow for the next edition."
  }
 ]
}

