        { "host": "A", "text": "$518 billion on cloud, computing and infrastructure obligations in coming years. Compute and infrastructure took $7.33 billion last year, a threefold rise from 2024 and more than half of total operating expenses of $12.65 billion. Cash and short-term investments were $20.28 billion at the end of December." },
